# Desktop companion

Windows code signing is out of scope. Do not reintroduce `signtool`, certificate secrets, or signed-build CI. Unsigned `.exe` is the supported path.

API tokens live in the OS credential store, not plaintext `config.json`. Escape any server string before `innerHTML` — use `clients/desktop/src/html.ts`; the source-scan ratchet in `html.test.ts` must stay green.

Do not redesign the member SPA from this tree. New server commands are a Backend handoff (`client_commands`), not a guessed route.
